  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Scannable
  displayName: Van Calox Mermaid
  scientificName: Piscis Humano Durum
  description: 'If the Dekarios Mermaid is peculiar, its cousin here is positively
    impertinent. The Van Calox presents a broadly humanoid silhouette: bipedal, upright,
    with a crustacean''s jointed limbs and a face that is at once blank and deeply
    accusatory. It stands upon the seabed as though it owns the place, which, I am
    increasingly prepared to concede, it may.'
  journalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9851bfdab89f3fb4d9375cd5f960c965, type: 3}
